# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Brother Sniper Bot v7 — Environment Config
# Usage:
#   cp .env.example .env
#   nano .env          ← fill in your real values
#   chmod 600 .env     ← lock permissions
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── XTB Account (REQUIRED) ───────────────────────────────
# Your XTB account NUMBER shown top-right in xStation 5
# It is a number like 12345678 — NOT your email address
XTB_USER=12345678
XTB_PASS=your_xtb_password_here

# Start on demo — change to false only after 2+ weeks demo testing
USE_DEMO=true

# ── Telegram (REQUIRED) ──────────────────────────────────
# Step 1: Open Telegram → search @BotFather → /newbot → copy token
TELEGRAM_TOKEN=123456789:AABBCCDDEEFFxxxx

# Step 2: Open Telegram → search @userinfobot → send any message → copy your ID
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=987654321

# ── Webhook Security (REQUIRED) ──────────────────────────
# Generate a strong secret:  openssl rand -hex 24
# This must match the "secret" field in your TradingView alert JSON
WEBHOOK_SECRET=replace_this_with_output_of_openssl_rand_hex_24

# ── HMAC Signature (OPTIONAL) ────────────────────────────
# Extra security layer. If set, TradingView must sign the webhook.
# Set same value in TradingView → Alert → Webhook → Secret field.
# Leave empty to skip HMAC verification (secret field still required).
TV_HMAC_SECRET=

# ── Trusted IPs / CIDRs (OPTIONAL but recommended) ───────
# TradingView IP ranges are already hardcoded in bot.py.
# Add your home IP so you can call /status /reset /close manually.
# Find your IP: https://whatismyip.com
# Supports single IPs and CIDR ranges, comma-separated:
#   TRUSTED_IPS=1.2.3.4
#   TRUSTED_IPS=1.2.3.4,5.6.7.8
#   TRUSTED_IPS=1.2.3.4,10.0.0.0/24
TRUSTED_IPS=YOUR_HOME_IP_HERE

# ── Account identity (ISO-01 / ISO-03, 2026-09-05) ─────────────────────────
# The ONE MT5 account v7 may touch. The Windows bridge asserts it against the
# terminal on every request; the bot sends it with every order and the bridge
# refuses any other. Missing = NOT RUNNABLE (no trades), never a default.
V7_MT5_LOGIN=52834417
# Magic number stamped on every v7 order (a tag, not a risk number). Must match
# the bridge's V7_MAGIC_NUMBER; positions opened before this carry magic 0 and
# a BS_ comment and stay manageable.
V7_MAGIC_NUMBER=70007

# ── Evidence-gated dials (08-01) — BOTH OFF until weekend review approves ──
# F8 tightening: counter-trend score multiplier 0.65 -> 0.50
F8_CT_50=false
# Per-symbol bench / size-down without code edits (see utils/asset_gate.py)
ASSET_GATE_ENABLED=false
ASSET_GATE_DISABLE=
ASSET_GATE_SIZE=
# example when approved:  ASSET_GATE_ENABLED=true  ASSET_GATE_SIZE=GOLD:0.5
